<p><strong>VVIP Reputation</strong><br>
When we first set sail in 2013 our mission was to get rid of tawdry sex games and add quality to the jaded and outdated booze cruise formula. VVIP was the first company to set sail at sunset when the fierce heat of the day has gone and the scenery is at its most beautiful.&nbsp; We’ve been a roaring success and have had some absolutely amazing evenings out on the ‘Ikaros Palace’. Please be sure to see our ‘<a href="https://vvipeventszante.com/galleries/">Hall of Fame</a>‘ gallery page for who has partied onboard with VVIP.</p>
<p><strong>Zante Boat Party Facts</strong></p>
<p>1. VVIP is the longest running boat party in Zante first setting sail 2013.</p>
<p>2. VVIP yacht party has been fully sold out every sailing for 9 years on the bounce and we have never cancelled. You can see every photo album on our Facebook page.</p>
<p>3. VVIP is the biggest boat party in Zante by any marker. We start earlier in the season, finish later, take 5 times as many people and have more people on board every sailing. Anyone telling you otherwise is lying to you so just think what else they are lying&nbsp;to you about? Everything to be frank, there is some shameful false advertising going on, you have been warned.</p>
<p>4. We happily feature pictures of our venue ‘Ikaros Palace’. NO OTHER BOAT PARTY in Zante does this, because they know it would be business suicide.</p>
<p>Many use pictures of boat party’s from Ibiza to trick you into thinking that’s what theirs looks like. It’s a terrible feeling to step off a coach expecting a big party boat only to discover you’re being crammed on a rusty old converted fishing boat with one shared toilet.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1156" src="https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/zante-boat-party.jpg" alt="zante boat party" width="100%" height="auto" srcset="https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/zante-boat-party.jpg 640w, https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/zante-boat-party-300x233.jpg 300w, https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/zante-boat-party-500x388.jpg 500w, https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/zante-boat-party-400x310.jpg 400w, https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/zante-boat-party-600x465.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px"></p>
<p>5. VVIP is the only boat party in Zante that is in charge of the bar onboard. Another crucial factor to our success and something we insisted on from the beginning. We only offer quality alcohol and we can give out free shots of Ciroc and Grey Goose without the Greeks going mad at us.</p>
<p>We are proud to have never offered a free bar. There is no such thing as a free bar. There is such a thing as shit drinks on a shit boat totally unsuitable for a party. A free bar on a boat is basically a big bucket of orange juice with peach syrup and grenadine in it.</p>
<p>6. There are numerous social media pages and groups set up by booze cruise promotors, a tactic brought over from Magaluf. You can spot them a mile off as they are always OFFICIAL. Please understand these pages always have an agenda. The truth is distorted with fake reviews posted by their staff and friends.</p>
<p>Negative comments about their boat party are deleted in seconds and 90% of what they claim to offer is complete lies. We think it’s a disgusting way to trick money out of people. Fake pictures. Fake reviews. Falsely advertised. If you are looking for real reviews to make a decision then use an authorised company like trust pilot or look for reviews on Twitter and Trip Advisor.</p>
<p>7. It’s a tricky business. Whether you get tricked by your hotel rep or tricked into giving over your card details for a free deposit you do need to watch out. VVIP Events Zante is a UK ltd company, a family run business with the same Greek and UK team running the events for 9 years.</p>
<p>Our reputation is of paramount importance to us. We don’t want to trick you, or lie to you, we are completely transparent and will happily refund you in full if you are not happy with what you receive.</p>
