                <p style="text-align: center;">Thinking about visiting Zakynthos aka Zante for your Summer Holiday in 2023?</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Well, if it’s beautiful beaches on a sun-drenched island with world class events and amazing nightlife that you seek – you’re on the right track!</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Read on to find out everything you need to know about the Zante nightlife, the Laganas Strip, bars, clubs, events and of course the beautiful beaches and excursions you can enjoy when you visit.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-1635 size-full" src="https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/zante-nightlife-guide-2.jpg" alt="zante nightlife guide" width="600" height="auto" srcset="https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/zante-nightlife-guide-2.jpg 600w, https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/zante-nightlife-guide-2-275x300.jpg 275w, https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/zante-nightlife-guide-2-500x545.jpg 500w, https://vvipeventszante.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/zante-nightlife-guide-2-400x436.jpg 400w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px"></p>
<p><strong>Why choose Zante for your summer holiday?</strong></p>
<p>One of the best things about Zante is that it’s great value. You can get return flights from the UK for around £150 and with booking.com and other websites allowing you to book hotels &amp; villas direct, there’s never been a better time to organise your own holiday, rather than use one of the big tour operators.</p>
<p>You should 100% look into booking your own flights and hotel rather than a package, always a lot cheaper.</p>
